OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers hand in plans to
OL,4,Aregenerate town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo planning applications have been
OL,7,Fsubmitted for a "landmark" regeneration
OL,8,Fproject that could "reimagine" a town
OL,9,Fcentre, developers said.
OL,11,FEnglish Cities Fund (ECF) said its
OL,12,Fplans for Greyfriars, Northampton, an
OL,13,Fold bus station that was demolished
OL,14,Fover a decade ago, and the listed Corn
OL,15,FExchange building, were now with West
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire Council.
OL,18,FThe site could include 1,200 homes and
OL,19,Fa mixture of leisure and community
OL,20,Fplaces, the developer added.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
