OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers hand in plans to
OL,4,Aregenerate town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the first application could be
OL,7,F"developed immediately" and will
OL,8,Finclude 103 new homes on the site of
OL,9,FUpper Mounts and Newlands car parks,
OL,10,Fwhich were expected to be built by
OL,11,F2029.
